      "writtenOn": "2021-07-02T21:46:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also, with this change, we can also deprecate some host commands, like EC_CMD_GET_SKU_ID, EC_CMD_SET_SKU_ID, EC_CMD_GET_BOARD_VERSION, as EC_CMD_SET_CROS_BOARD_INFO and EC_CMD_GET_CROS_BOARD_INFO should be sufficient.",
      "parentUuid": "5b42f245_122a34b2",
      "revId": "50693e7d0915405f2e165472eed42d54c3548cfd",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
