      "writtenOn": "2021-07-03T00:55:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Also, with this change, we can also deprecate some host commands, like EC_CMD_GET_SKU_ID, EC_CMD_SET_SKU_ID, EC_CMD_GET_BOARD_VERSION, as EC_CMD_SET_CROS_BOARD_INFO and EC_CMD_GET_CROS_BOARD_INFO should be sufficient.\n\nYeah, if that clean-up is also coming together, I agree CONFIG_CBI_GPIO is better. One caveat is that we waste uint8_t cbi[CBI_IMAGE_SIZE]. I hope you\u0027ll take care of it too?",
