      "writtenOn": "2021-07-07T21:38:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because CONFIG_CBI_GPIO implies that only the CBI_TAG_BOARD_VERSION and CBI_TAG_SKU_ID tags will be saved (each of which is uint32_t), you can reduce the static allocation of the CBI area to:\n    sizeof(struct cbi_header) + 2 * (sizeof(struct cbi_data) + sizeof(uint32_t))",
      "parentUuid": "166b6e3b_2f58ef48",
      "revId": "50693e7d0915405f2e165472eed42d54c3548cfd",
